This repository contains work derived from Herdr Desktop (herdr-app 0.1.15),
which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- mods/code-files/ started as a copy of Herdr's shipped "files" mod
  (made with `mod.clone`). It was modified to edit files, keep unsaved
  drafts, show diffs, and open files on request from the Git panel
  (the block marked "git-panel integration" in main.js).
- mods/git-tabs/ started as a copy of Herdr's shipped "tabs" mod. It was
  modified to add a "Git" panel button next to Files and Changes.
- layouts/main-code.json started as a copy of Herdr's "main" layout, with a
  "git" block added to the right panel and the tab bar switched to git-tabs.
- The gpui-kit.d.ts and jsconfig.json files in each mod folder are Herdr's
  type definitions, copied unchanged by `mod.clone`.

mods/git-panel/ is original work.
